        "cooked": "<blockquote><p>If there's one thing I've learned about the templating in SotM, it's that economy of words is important to the team (eg: every instance of \"would\" that lacks an \"instead\").</p></blockquote><p>If they'd just replace \"at the beginning of the XYZ turn\" or \"at the end of the XYZ turn\" with an icon, they'd have lots of room to add \"insteads\"...</p>",
